        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;CHÚ THÍCH&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt; khoá chính &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; &lt;i&gt;FK&lt;/i&gt; khoá ngoại &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; [UQ] unique index &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; [IDX] index&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;IDX (A, B)&lt;/i&gt; index ghép &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; &lt;code&gt;= x&lt;/code&gt; giá trị mặc định &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; NULL cho phép rỗng&lt;br&gt;Đầu đường nối (crow's foot): ┼ đúng 1 &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; o┼ 0..1 &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; o&amp;lt; 0..N&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;GIÁ TRỊ ENUM&lt;/b&gt; (lưu dạng chuỗi, EF HasConversion&amp;lt;string&amp;gt;)&lt;br&gt;Reservations.Status: Pending | Confirmed | Completed | Cancelled&lt;br&gt;Deposits.Status: Pending | Paid | Refunded | Forfeited&lt;br&gt;Deposits / Invoices.PaymentMethod: Cash | Card | BankTransfer&lt;br&gt;Tables.Status: Available | LockedForPayment | Reserved | Occupied | Cleaning&lt;br&gt;Tables.Zone: MainHall | VIP | Balcony&lt;br&gt;Orders.Status: Processing | Completed | Cancelled&lt;br&gt;OrderItems.Status: Hold | Preparing | Served | Cancelled&lt;br&gt;Staffs.Role: Waitstaff | Expediter | Admin&lt;br&gt;MenuItems / TastingMenuItems.CourseType: Appetizer | MainCourse | Dessert | Beverage&lt;br&gt;MenuItems.Status: chuỗi tự do (mặc định 'Available')&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;QUY TẮC&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Mỗi OrderItems có đúng một trong MenuItemId / TastingMenuId (món lẻ hoặc set menu).&lt;br&gt;• ON DELETE CASCADE: Reservations→Deposits, Feedbacks; Orders→OrderItems; TastingMenus→TastingMenuItems.&lt;br&gt;• ON DELETE SET NULL: Reservations→Orders.ReservationId. Các khoá ngoại còn lại: RESTRICT." style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;dashed=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="720" width="440" height="370" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
